# Portfolio Project Overview

React 18 + TypeScript portfolio deployed to GitHub Pages (https://ycrao573.github.io).

## Stack

- Vite+ (`vp` CLI) for dev, lint, format, test, build
- Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui (`radix-nova` style)
- Motion for animations
- React Three Fiber + r3f-globe for the world map
- i18n via `src/locale/` (EN + ZH)
- External API at `src/services/api.ts` (Cloudflare Workers)

## Layout

- Entry: `src/main.tsx` → `I18nProvider` → `app-root.tsx` → `pages/home-page/`
- Sections live in `src/components/<name>.tsx` (flat) or `src/components/<name>/` (multi-file only)
- shadcn primitives in `src/components/ui/`
- Use `@/` import alias for `src/`

## Conventions

- kebab-case file and folder names (enforced by lint)
- User-facing strings via `useI18n().t('key')` in both `en.json` and `zh.json`
- Validate changes: `vp check`, `vp test`, `vp build`

See `AGENTS.md` for full architecture and task recipes.
